(2 < 9) nnete: { Sephetho ngola: ['Yes, nine is less than ten.']. }.
(9 < 2) nnete: { Sephetho ngola: ['My logic fails']. }.
Sephetho ngola: (-2 + 6).
Sephetho ngola: (-3 - -3).
>> TrueIsNice := 3.
Sephetho ngola: TrueIsNice.
>> FalseIsBad := ['Not true!'].
Sephetho ngola: FalseIsBad.
>> NilIsEmpty := ['Yep'].
Sephetho ngola: NilIsEmpty.
